msgid "dae Engine"
msgstr "dae 引擎"

msgid ""
"The doona panel serves the dae engine over its native HTTP API. It runs in "
"the browser, so this page only frames it."
msgstr ""
"doona 面板透過 dae 的原生 HTTP API 驅動引擎。它在瀏覽器裡執行，本頁只是把它框起來。"

msgid ""
"The panel asks for the API secret on first use. Read it with: uci get "
"dae.main.api_secret"
msgstr ""
"面板首次開啟時會要求輸入 API 金鑰。查看方式：uci get dae.main.api_secret"
